509_T07R0501_00001":"Whew...\\rI’ve got to stay calm and collected...\\rI can’t lose my cool.\\nIf I spend all my time playing here,\\fI could get in trouble at home.","msg_0509_T07R0501_00002":"I woke up and realized my potential!\\rSo, what potential was woken in me?\\nWhat’s my hidden power, you ask?\\rIt’s a power that lets me see the\\nHidden Power of a Pokémon.\\rWhen they learn that move, I can tell\\nwhat type the move will be.\\rSo, want me to use my hidden power?\\rI’ll tell you what type your\\nPokémon’s Hidden Power will be. {YESNO 0}","msg_0509_T07R0501_00003":"I’ll tell you what type your Pokémon’s\\nHidden Power will be.\\rMy own hidden power lets me\\ndo that. {YESNO 0}","msg_0509_T07R0501_00004":"If this Pokémon were to learn\\nHidden Power, the move’s type\\fwould be {STRVAR_1 15, 0, 0}.","msg_0509_T07R0501_00005":"This Pokémon’s Hidden Power is the\\n{STRVAR_1 15, 0, 0} type.","msg_0509_T07R0501_00006":"If you want to know, ask me, and I’ll\\nactivate my hidden power for you.","msg_0509_T07R0501_00007":"A move that an Egg can learn?!\\nThat’s flat-out impossible.","msg_0509_T07R0501_00008":"Oh, no. This Pokémon can’t learn the\\nmove Hidden Power in the first place.","msg_0509_T07R0501_00009":"Welcome!\\rWe exchange your game coins for\\nfabulous prizes! {YESNO 0}","msg_0509_T07R0501_00010":"OK. Please save your coins and\\ncome again!","msg_0509_T07R0501_00011":"Sorry! You need more coins. {YESNO 0}","msg_0509_T07R0501_00012":"{STRVAR_1 8, 0, 0}.\\nIs that right? {YESNO 0}","msg_0509_T07R0501_00013":"Here you go!\\r","msg_0509_T07R0501_00014":"Sorry. You can’t carry any more.\\r","msg_0509_T07R0501_00015":"Your party’s full!\\nPlease make some room\\fbefore you come back.","msg_0509_T07R0501_00016":"Would you like {STRVAR_1 0, 1, 0}? {YESNO 0}","msg_0509_T07R0501_00017":"{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} received\\nthe {STRVAR_1 0, 1, 0}! {YESNO 0}","msg_0509_T07R0501_00018":"Welcome!\\rWe exchange your coins for\\nfabulous prizes! {YESNO 0}","msg_0509_T07R0501